  "details": "The player counts on worlds, the location of friends, the online and offline status of friends both in the main menu and the wings is constantly incorrect. Friends that went offline hours ago still appear in the list sometimes. Worlds that are set to 30 people, sometime appear as 40 people (even with like 5 people inside), and the number of players in an instance are constantly incorrect. Sometimes things seem to update if you scroll the wing menu. We are NOT in this instance for example. If I scroll the menu the instance picture updates. If I go back to the main menu the wing goes back to the incorrect instance picture.",
